    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "purpose? how?? i've lost everything. my house, my reputation, the people i thought were my family... they all turned on me. it feels like the world is just designed to crush people like me for even trying to be good. i'm just so tired of fighting a system that won't even acknowledge i exist anymore. i'm just... done.",
